{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36266","headline":"送永嘉王令之任二首 二 · 方干","name":"送永嘉王令之任二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽展县图如到县，五程犹入缙云东。\n山间阁道盘岩底，海界孤峰在浪中。\n礼法未闻离汉制，土宜多说似吴风。\n字人若用非常术，唯要旬时便立功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}